<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch bonds end strong after benign U.S. payrolls.</title>
<headline>Dutch bonds end strong after benign U.S. payrolls.</headline>
<text>
<p>---------------------(Snapshot at 1532 GMT)---------------------</p>
<p>* DUTCH STATE LOANS	 PRICES			  BID YIELDS</p>
<p>  June 1999 7.50 pct	107.11/21 (+0.01)	   3.62 (-0.01)</p>
<p>  Feb  2002		   115.22/32 (+0.10)	   4.50 (-0.02)</p>
